<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-3M downgraded by DLJ.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-3M downgraded by DLJ.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Market sources said Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette analyst Ty Govatos downgraded his rating on Minnesota Mining &amp; Manufacturing Co to underperform from market performer.</p>
<p>--The downgrade was based purely on the increased share price of last week, sources said.</p>
<p>--Shares in the St. Paul, Minn.-based diversified manufacturer were off 1/4 to 74-1/8.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
